      "title": "TJX International's Adjusted Margin Hits 7.3%: More Upside Ahead?",
      "summary": "TJX Companies' International division achieved significant profitability gains in Q2 FY2027, with adjusted segment profit margin rising 210 basis points year-over-year to 7.3%. The division reported net sales of $2.09 billion, up 11% from the prior year, driven by higher customer transactions and 7% comparable sales growth. The margin improvement was supported by favorable merchandise margins and expense leverage, while the company continued expansion efforts in Europe.",
